There should be the option on SCR-000-new-game to select the number of players in the game. This is a player selector bar above the board size selector with all 6 colours. Tapping one of these puts a tick in it. After choosing the board and going to SCR-001, from this point onwards, the player selector will only have the colours selected at new game.

In the burger menu there should be an option to change players. This takes us to SCR-007-change-players (make this page if it doesn't exist) which allows ticking more colours.
